idence**: high / medium / low\n4. **Tradeoffs**: the specific XSS-vs-CSRF tradeoff and any modern mitigations (SameSite=Strict/Lax, BFF pattern, token-bound cookies, etc.)\n\nDo NOT synthesize across other analysts' views. Do NOT write files. Return your structured answer only.","outputFile":"<scrubbed-path>","canReadOutputFile":true}}
